{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a mechanic, have picked up three robots from a scrapyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/ffcc4a8e963ce0c89aae974a38a557d0.poster.avif?t=1757520614\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/ffcc4a8e963ce0c89aae974a38a557d0.webm?t=1757520614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/ffcc4a8e963ce0c89aae974a38a557d0.mp4?t=1757520614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;J.S.C.A&quot; : a robot waitress at the diner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b36eacd2fd958484781d2f2709a08303.poster.avif?t=1757520614\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b36eacd2fd958484781d2f2709a08303.webm?t=1757520614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b36eacd2fd958484781d2f2709a08303.mp4?t=1757520614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Surverry&quot; : a security robot for monitoring offices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b699a2a1f5d8b0f1facd5202b2e275ac.poster.avif?t=1757520614\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b699a2a1f5d8b0f1facd5202b2e275ac.webm?t=1757520614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b699a2a1f5d8b0f1facd5202b2e275ac.mp4?t=1757520614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Devind R7&quot; : a combat robot that seems to have been developed for military use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dimly lit garage, you charge and revive the robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After that, you can peek into their memories through dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or you can enjoy the robots' reactions by applying high voltage to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, their batteries only have a short lifespan left. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How they spend the rest of their lives is in your hands...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME DESIGN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select one of three robots and charge and converse with them within a time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you treat them will change their reactions, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the ending of the game will change little by little along with their fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the owner of the electrical outlet and the high-voltage switch, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >have the power to make your robots happy or unhappy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with the same robot over and over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can aim to unlock all ending achievements, or you can just try to make the robots happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nostalgic 4-color pixel art reminiscent of 90's portable game consoles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy various conversations with attractive robot characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each play time is about 15 minutes, so you can play easily</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3005930?t=1757520614","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3005930?t=1757520614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/9dd375f8e9df412dd75d0d3ac868523e1dc33bd4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757520614","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/9dd375f8e9df412dd75d0d3ac868523e1dc33bd4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757520614","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3098870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a mechanic, have picked up three robots from a scrapyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/ffcc4a8e963ce0c89aae974a38a557d0.poster.avif?t=1757520614\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/ffcc4a8e963ce0c89aae974a38a557d0.webm?t=1757520614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/ffcc4a8e963ce0c89aae974a38a557d0.mp4?t=1757520614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;J.S.C.A&quot; : a robot waitress at the diner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b36eacd2fd958484781d2f2709a08303.poster.avif?t=1757520614\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b36eacd2fd958484781d2f2709a08303.webm?t=1757520614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b36eacd2fd958484781d2f2709a08303.mp4?t=1757520614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Surverry&quot; : a security robot for monitoring offices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b699a2a1f5d8b0f1facd5202b2e275ac.poster.avif?t=1757520614\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b699a2a1f5d8b0f1facd5202b2e275ac.webm?t=1757520614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/extras/b699a2a1f5d8b0f1facd5202b2e275ac.mp4?t=1757520614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Devind R7&quot; : a combat robot that seems to have been developed for military use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dimly lit garage, you charge and revive the robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After that, you can peek into their memories through dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or you can enjoy the robots' reactions by applying high voltage to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, their batteries only have a short lifespan left. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How they spend the rest of their lives is in your hands...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME DESIGN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select one of three robots and charge and converse with them within a time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you treat them will change their reactions, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the ending of the game will change little by little along with their fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the owner of the electrical outlet and the high-voltage switch, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >have the power to make your robots happy or unhappy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with the same robot over and over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can aim to unlock all ending achievements, or you can just try to make the robots happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nostalgic 4-color pixel art reminiscent of 90's portable game consoles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy various conversations with attractive robot characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Each play time is about 15 minutes, so you can play easily</p>","developers":["72studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005930/header.jpg?t=1757520614","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong